WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:10.020
I was a specialist in the United States Army
and served in Fort Bragg, North Carolina.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:15.279
I'm a native Michigan resident, and so I already
knew about Hillsdale. It's a true quality

00:00:15.279 --> 00:00:20.480
education. Coming out, that's what I want.
I want to learn stuff, not just get a piece

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:25.280
of paper, you know? The fact that they don't
accept government money is so they can teach

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:29.720
what they truly believe without inference
from the government. I think it's a really

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:34.190
important part of Hillsdale. When they don't
accept government money, of course, that includes

00:00:34.190 --> 00:00:39.360
the GI bill. That would be a big concern except
for they offer military scholarships, and

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:44.570
those in my case, are a full ride. It includes
where I live, which isn't just a normal dorm.

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:52.480
It's off campus, a house. It includes tuition,
it includes a book stipend of $500, it includes meals

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:57.660
The professors really seem to care. If you
come up and ask them questions, they're going

00:00:57.670 --> 00:01:02.090
to take a personal interest in making sure
you understand the subject they're teaching.

00:01:02.090 --> 00:01:07.079
They also care as far as to whether you're
actually there or not. It's so small that

00:01:07.079 --> 00:01:12.569
they actually can care. The transition from
the military to here was good. I'm on the

00:01:12.569 --> 00:01:17.749
football team too so there's a little bit
of that physicalness still in there. If you're

00:01:17.749 --> 00:01:21.979
a little bit behind because like me, you've
been out for a long time, they really take

00:01:21.979 --> 00:01:26.740
a patience and work with you, and they understand
that you haven't been doing that like everybody

00:01:26.740 --> 00:01:29.369
else has for four years straight.

00:01:29.369 --> 00:01:33.709
Everything's just very well put together with
the athletics, and it's not so much that it's

00:01:33.709 --> 00:01:37.829
focused on athletics, and that's what you
expected to only do, because the focus is

00:01:37.829 --> 00:01:39.549
still on education.

